{"id":69021,"date":"2025-05-27T18:28:11","date_gmt":"2025-05-27T17:28:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69021"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:48:39","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:48:39","slug":"trail-do-miscaro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-miscaro\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do M\u00edscaro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do M\u00edscaro 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail do M\u00edscaro 2026<\/strong> (12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>15 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida agendada para as <strong>09:30<\/strong> em <strong>Aguiar da Beira<\/strong>, distrito da <strong>Guarda<\/strong>. Este conceituado evento de trail running e caminhada na natureza celebra as paisagens beir\u00e3s e a rica tradi\u00e7\u00e3o micol\u00f3gica da regi\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo apresenta as provas competitivas de <strong>Trail Longo (22 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Trail Curto (15 km)<\/strong>, a par das vertentes recreativas de <strong>Mini Trail (10 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong>. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, postos de abastecimento, seguran\u00e7a, almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para atletas e planta\u00e7\u00e3o de \u00e1rvores aut\u00f3ctones.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>Jornal +Aguiar da Beira<\/strong> (Pinto &#038; Gon\u00e7alves \u2013 Mais Comunica\u00e7\u00e3o e Eventos, Lda.) e do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Aguiar da Beira<\/strong>, com o apoio de institui\u00e7\u00f5es locais para assegurar uma organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica exemplar e acolhedora.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" st